# LeakSanitizer suppressions of the leak run (tsan.yml, job "leaks").
#
# Only for leaks the player cannot fix: allocations that FFmpeg, the C
# library or OpenSSL make for themselves and never free, independent of how
# the player uses them. Every entry says why. A leak whose stack goes
# through the player's own code (container/, main/, output/, manager/,
# playback/, tools/) is never suppressed here: the player may have missed a
# close or free, that is what the run is for.
#
# Format: leak:<function, file or library name>
